
# Personal strategy notes, symlinked into a private vault. Not this repo's
# to publish, and a dangling link for anyone else.
draftroom_2026.md

# Your live one-per-offense / no-handcuff filters — personal strategy, kept
# out of the public repo. `preferences.example.yaml` is the tracked template.
preferences.yaml

# The durable shortlist of sampled target rosters — your strategy, and written
# by the board at runtime. One file per owner id, because a guest board shares
# this directory and must not read or overwrite yours.
saved-teams*.json
saved-teams*.json.tmp
